     diffed in attempt 1 — `git diff master -- portfolio-settings.html`
     shows them as unchanged context lines this attempt too. Still a
     pre-existing, sitewide AA contrast gap (2.54:1 light / 3.04:1 dark,
     both below 4.5:1), still not introduced or worsened by W2, still an
     OBSERVATION for a follow-up task, not a blocker here.
   - Check 3 (no aria-live on the phase-note figure): unchanged from
     attempt 1, consistent with every other quick-adjust display span on
